msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Redirects** | Redirection, Safe Redirect Manager, Simple 301 Redirects, 301 Redirects (WebFactory) | **Redirects** surface — list + in-place edit + bulk delete; Redirection's first-run install runs in place via the setup gate, its daily options (monitor, log retention, IP logging) live in a Settings view through its own __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__, and a status card leads the surface (rules, hits, served/404 counts and a stacked 14-day chart from its log tables) |"
msgstr "| **重新導向** | Redirection、Safe Redirect Manager、Simple 301 Redirects、301 Redirects (WebFactory) | **Redirects** 介面——清單＋就地編輯＋批次刪除；Redirection 的首次安裝會透過設定閘門就地執行，其每日選項（監控、日誌保留、IP 記錄）透過其自己的 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 位於 Settings 檢視中，且狀態卡片會引導此介面（規則、命中數、服務／404 計數，以及根據其日誌資料表產生的 14 日堆疊圖表） |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:44
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Public preview** | Public Post Preview | Editor Publish card: **Public preview link** toggle + copy URL; content row **Copy public preview link** (enables if needed). Shareable anonymous draft links use the plugin's own expiring nonces and Reading expiry setting |"
