#: docs/plugin-support.md:23
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Podcasting** | Seriously Simple Podcasting, PowerPress | SSP: episodes are a REST CPT, so the Content list and Minimal editor already carry them; the **Podcast episode** editor panel adds the whole episode-detail estate (file URL, audio/video type, duration, file size, date recorded, explicit and block flags, the iTunes fields) read live from SSP's own schema and stored in its own conventions (cover image and Castos hosting sync stay SSP's). PowerPress: the same panel on plain posts for the default channel (media URL, size, duration, subtitle, Apple episode fields), rebuilding its enclosure blob diff-based so hosting, chapters and artwork keys survive untouched; custom channels, artwork, explicit and chapters stay on its metabox |"
msgstr "| **Podcasting** | Seriously Simple Podcasting、PowerPress | SSP：單集是 REST CPT，因此 Content 清單與 Minimal 編輯器已包含這些內容；**Podcast episode** 編輯器面板會新增完整的單集詳細設定（檔案 URL、音訊／影片類型、時長、檔案大小、錄製日期、明確內容與封鎖標記、iTunes 欄位），即時從 SSP 自身的結構描述讀取，並依其自身慣例儲存（封面圖片與 Castos 託管同步仍由 SSP 管理）。PowerPress：預設頻道的普通文章也會使用相同面板（媒體 URL、大小、時長、副標題、Apple 單集欄位），以差異為基礎重建其 enclosure blob，確保託管、章節與美術圖鍵值原封不動；自訂頻道、美術圖、明確內容與章節仍保留在其 metabox 中 |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:41
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Performance** | Perfmatters, Autoptimize, Asset CleanUp, Performance Lab | One **Performance** Tools item with a provider switcher. **Perfmatters** (settings-only): whole estate from its live core-Settings-API registrations. **Autoptimize** (settings-only): JS / CSS / HTML / CDN / Misc toggles written as its own __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__/empty options (Critical CSS, Extra and Image stay deep-linked; Clear site cache still purges its cache). **Asset CleanUp** (settings-only): global minify/combine/cleanup/fonts/test-mode toggles via its JSON settings option; the page-level CSS/JS unload manager stays in Asset CleanUp. **Performance Lab**: list of WordPress Performance Team standalone features (activate through its own install helper, deactivate through core); Server Timing and per-feature settings stay deep-linked |"
msgstr "| **效能** | Perfmatters、Autoptimize、Asset CleanUp、Performance Lab | 一個包含提供者切換器的 **Performance** Tools 項目。**Perfmatters**（僅設定）：透過其即時核心 Settings-API 註冊項目取得完整設定。**Autoptimize**（僅設定）：JS／CSS／HTML／CDN／Misc 切換項目會寫入其自身的 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__／空值選項（Critical CSS、Extra 與 Image 仍維持深層連結；Clear site cache 仍會清除其快取）。**Asset CleanUp**（僅設定）：透過其 JSON 設定選項提供全域最小化／合併／清理／字型／測試模式切換項目；頁面層級的 CSS／JS 卸載管理器仍保留在 Asset CleanUp 中。**Performance Lab**：列出 WordPress Performance Team 的獨立功能（透過其自身的安裝輔助程式啟用，透過核心停用）；Server Timing 與各功能設定仍維持深層連結 |"

