#: docs/plugin-support.md:45
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Media** | Regenerate Thumbnails, Force Regenerate Thumbnails, Safe SVG, SVG Support, Enable Media Replace, FileBird, Real Media Library, Folders by Premio | ↻ Thumbnails button on the media detail modal (per-image full rebuild; Force Regenerate Thumbnails covers the same button through its own admin-ajax handler when RT is absent). Safe SVG or SVG Support: **SVG** filter tab; detail note names the provider (sanitization claimed only for Safe SVG); sanitization stays the plugin's. Enable Media Replace: **⇅ Replace file** on the detail modal through EMR's own ReplaceController (same name, same URL; same-type enforced; rename-and-move stays on EMR's screen). Folders: FileBird, Real Media Library Lite and Folders by Premio all feed the Media view's folder combobox via the __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ provider contract (browse-first; organizing stays in each plugin's UI) |"
msgstr "| **媒體** | Regenerate Thumbnails、Force Regenerate Thumbnails、Safe SVG、SVG Support、Enable Media Replace、FileBird、Real Media Library、Folders by Premio | 媒體詳細資料模態視窗中的 ↻ 縮圖按鈕（每張圖片完整重建；當 RT 不存在時，Force Regenerate Thumbnails 會透過其自身的 admin-ajax 處理常式提供相同按鈕）。Safe SVG 或 SVG Support：**SVG** 篩選分頁；詳細資料備註會標示提供者（僅 Safe SVG 宣稱提供清理）；清理仍由外掛負責。Enable Media Replace：詳細資料模態視窗中的 **⇅ Replace file**，透過 EMR 自身的 ReplaceController（名稱相同、URL 相同；強制相同類型；重新命名及移動仍在 EMR 畫面中處理）。資料夾：FileBird、Real Media Library Lite 和 Folders by Premio 都透過 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 提供者合約，將資料夾選擇組合框提供給 Media 檢視（優先瀏覽；整理仍在各外掛的 UI 中進行） |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:36
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Licenses** | Elementor Pro, ACF PRO, WP Rocket, Gravity Forms, Gravity SMTP, AnalyticsWP, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, WPBakery, Brizy, Etch, Astra/Brainstorm family, WPMU DEV (Dashboard + Smush Pro), SearchWP, Gravity Perks, Rank Math Pro, Perfmatters, GP Premium, WP All Import/Export Pro, Slider Revolution, LayerSlider, Avada, Envato Market, The Events Calendar family (Pro, Event Tickets Plus, Filter Bar, Community, each a dedicated provider) + any other StellarWP Uplink or PUE product generically, Kadence Blocks Pro, Smash Balloon (Instagram / Facebook / YouTube / Twitter / Social Wall / Reviews / TikTok / Feed Analytics Pro, including All Plugins multi-product keys), Yoast SEO Premium (MyYoast portal), Search & Filter Pro, Admin Columns Pro, plus any Freemius, EDD Software Licensing or SureCart plugin generically | Extensions → **Licenses** tab (grouped by state, inactive components collapsed, actions in a per-row menu; the System health check is the clickable doorway): valid / expired / invalid / missing per paid component; paste-to-activate for Elementor Pro, ACF PRO, Gravity Forms, Gravity SMTP, Beaver Builder, Brizy Pro, Etch, Bricks and Divi (active theme; Divi takes username + API key), WPMU DEV, SearchWP, Gravity Perks, Perfmatters, GP Premium, WP All Export Pro, LayerSlider, all four The Events Calendar products, Kadence Blocks Pro, Search & Filter Pro and Admin Columns Pro, deactivate and re-verify where each vendor's code allows, and an \"Activate ↗\" link for portal- or admin-context-bound vendors (WPBakery, Rank Math, Envato, WP All Import, Slider Revolution), all through each vendor's own code; open via __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ |"
msgstr "| **授權** | Elementor Pro、ACF PRO、WP Rocket、Gravity Forms、Gravity SMTP、AnalyticsWP、Bricks、Divi、Beaver Builder、WPBakery、Brizy、Etch、Astra/Brainstorm 系列、WPMU DEV（Dashboard + Smush Pro）、SearchWP、Gravity Perks、Rank Math Pro、Perfmatters、GP Premium、WP All Import/Export Pro、Slider Revolution、LayerSlider、Avada、Envato Market、The Events Calendar 系列（Pro、Event Tickets Plus、Filter Bar、Community，各自為專用提供者）+ 任何其他 StellarWP Uplink 或 PUE 產品的一般支援、Kadence Blocks Pro、Smash Balloon（Instagram／Facebook／YouTube／Twitter／Social Wall／Reviews／TikTok／Feed Analytics Pro，包括 All Plugins 多產品金鑰）、Yoast SEO Premium（MyYoast 入口網站）、Search & Filter Pro、Admin Columns Pro，以及任何 Freemius、EDD Software Licensing 或 SureCart 外掛的一般支援 | Extensions → **授權**分頁（依狀態分組、停用元件收合、操作位於每列選單中；System health 檢查是可點擊的入口）：每個付費元件的有效／已過期／無效／缺少狀態；Elementor Pro、ACF PRO、Gravity Forms、Gravity SMTP、Beaver Builder、Brizy Pro、Etch、Bricks 和 Divi（作用中的佈景主題；Divi 需要使用者名稱＋API 金鑰）、WPMU DEV、SearchWP、Gravity Perks、Perfmatters、GP Premium、WP All Export Pro、LayerSlider、The Events Calendar 的全部四項產品、Kadence Blocks Pro、Search & Filter Pro 和 Admin Columns Pro 支援貼上啟用，並在各供應商程式碼允許時停用及重新驗證；對於受入口網站或管理員情境限制的供應商（WPBakery、Rank Math、Envato、WP All Import、Slider Revolution）提供「啟用 ↗」連結，全部透過各供應商自身程式碼處理；透過 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 開啟 |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:22
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Jobs** | WP Job Manager | Listings are a REST CPT, so the Content list and Minimal editor already carry them; the **Job listing** editor panel adds the details estate (location, company fields, application email or URL, salary, remote/filled/featured flags, expiry) read live from WPJM's own field schema, with WPJM's own per-field sanitizers ruling every write |"
msgstr "| **工作** | WP Job Manager | 清單是 REST CPT，因此 Content 清單和 Minimal 編輯器已支援；**工作清單**編輯器面板新增詳細資料範圍（地點、公司欄位、申請電子郵件或 URL、薪資、遠端／已填補／精選標記、到期日），即時從 WPJM 自身欄位結構描述讀取，所有寫入均由 WPJM 自身的個別欄位清理器處理 |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:24
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Forms** | Gravity Forms, WPForms, Fluent Forms, Elementor Pro, Contact Form 7 (via Flamingo), CFDB7, Ninja Forms, Forminator, Formidable, Everest Forms, SureForms | **Forms** surface — entries as contact cards. Providers with status workflows (Everest, Fluent, Ninja, Flamingo, Elementor Pro) share Received/Spam-or-Unread/Trash filters with restore and bulk; CFDB7 filters All/Unread/Read. Fluent Forms, Ninja Forms, Forminator, Flamingo, Everest Forms, SureForms and WPForms open with a status card (unread or received counts, spam and trash where tracked, form count, link to the plugin's entries screen). WPForms (Pro, which is where entries live) gets the full treatment: per-form tabs, unread/read/starred/spam/trash filters, star and read state, spam and trash flows with restore, permanent delete through WPForms' own handler, and entries that mark themselves viewed when opened, all behind WPForms' own access capabilities. Gravity Forms adds the full entry workflow through its own endpoints: Received/Spam/Trash status views, star/unstar and mark-read (open marks read like GF's own screen), restore and delete-permanently where they apply, bulk actions, entry notes on the card plus add-a-note, and resend notifications. A **Notifications** view (edit-forms capability, via GF's own resolver) lists every notification across forms with type-aware recipients (address / field label / routing rule count), activate-deactivate through GF's own toggle, and daily-field editing (name, send-to, subject, message) through GF's own notifications store; routing rules, conditional logic and events stay in GF's editor, one deep link away. Each form's row opens **Form settings**: the whole form-settings estate (basics, layout, save-and-continue, restrictions, spam detection, options) drawn at request time from GF's own Settings-framework schema and saved through __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ with GF's own validation semantics; schedule date-times stay in GF, honestly counted as locked. A **Feeds** view (shown while a feed add-on is registered) lists every add-on integration across forms with activate, deactivate and delete through GF's own model; feed configuration deep-links to the add-on's screen. SureForms entries ride its clean JSON table with per-form tabs, read/unread/trash status actions, search, delete and a status card |"
msgstr "| **表單** | Gravity Forms、WPForms、Fluent Forms、Elementor Pro、Contact Form 7（透過 Flamingo）、CFDB7、Ninja Forms、Forminator、Formidable、Everest Forms、SureForms | **表單**介面 — 以聯絡人卡片顯示項目。具備狀態工作流程的提供者（Everest、Fluent、Ninja、Flamingo、Elementor Pro）共用已接收／垃圾郵件或未讀／垃圾桶篩選器，並支援還原和批次操作；CFDB7 提供全部／未讀／已讀篩選器。Fluent Forms、Ninja Forms、Forminator、Flamingo、Everest Forms、SureForms 和 WPForms 開啟時會顯示狀態卡（未讀或已接收數量、追蹤中的垃圾郵件和垃圾桶數量、表單數量、前往外掛項目畫面的連結）。WPForms（項目存放於 Pro）提供完整功能：每個表單的分頁、未讀／已讀／已加星號／垃圾郵件／垃圾桶篩選器、星號和已讀狀態、具備還原功能的垃圾郵件和垃圾桶流程、透過 WPForms 自身處理常式永久刪除，以及開啟時自動標記為已檢視的項目，全部受 WPForms 自身存取權限保護。Gravity Forms 透過自身端點新增完整項目工作流程：已接收／垃圾郵件／垃圾桶狀態檢視、加星號／取消星號及標記為已讀（開啟時會像 GF 自身畫面一樣標記為已讀）、適用時的還原和永久刪除、批次操作、卡片上的項目備註及新增備註，以及重新寄送通知。**通知**檢視（透過 GF 自身解析器，需具備 edit-forms 權限）會列出所有表單中的每則通知，並顯示具類型感知的收件者（地址／欄位標籤／路由規則數量），透過 GF 自身切換功能啟用／停用，並透過 GF 自身通知儲存區編輯每日欄位（名稱、寄送至、主旨、訊息）；路由規則、條件邏輯和事件仍在 GF 編輯器中，僅需一個深層連結即可前往。每個表單的列都會開啟 **表單設定**：完整表單設定範圍（基本設定、版面配置、儲存並繼續、限制、垃圾郵件偵測、選項）會在請求時從 GF 自身 Settings-framework 結構描述取得，並透過 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 以 GF 自身驗證語意儲存；排程日期時間仍由 GF 處理，並如實列為已鎖定。**Feeds**檢視（註冊 feed 外掛時顯示）會列出所有表單中的外掛整合，並透過 GF 自身模型啟用、停用和刪除；feed 設定會深層連結至外掛畫面。SureForms 項目使用其簡潔的 JSON 表格，提供每個表單的分頁、已讀／未讀／垃圾桶狀態操作、搜尋、刪除和狀態卡 |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:21
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Events** | The Events Calendar | Events are a REST CPT, so the Content list and Minimal editor already carry them; the **Event details** editor panel covers start/end, all-day, venue and organizer (async-search pickers over TEC's own records), cost and website, all written through TEC's own saveEventMeta (duration, UTC mirrors and linked-post bookkeeping stay TEC's). Multiple organizers, recurrence, tickets, timezone and venue/organizer creation stay in TEC |"
msgstr "| **活動** | The Events Calendar | 活動是 REST CPT，因此 Content 清單和 Minimal 編輯器已支援；**活動詳細資料**編輯器面板涵蓋開始／結束時間、全天、場地和主辦人（透過 TEC 自身記錄進行非同步搜尋選擇器）、費用和網站，所有內容都透過 TEC 自身的 saveEventMeta 寫入（持續時間、UTC 鏡像和關聯文章的管理仍由 TEC 負責）。多位主辦人、週期性活動、票券、時區及建立場地／主辦人仍在 TEC 中處理 |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:25
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Email** | Gravity SMTP, FluentSMTP, WP Mail SMTP, Post SMTP, WP Mail Logging, SureMails, Site Mailer | **Email** surface (renamed from Email Log once it grew settings) — sent mail, resend, single/bulk log delete. FluentSMTP, Post SMTP and WP Mail Logging all have status cards (14-day charts); FluentSMTP also has test send, subject/from/to search, single/bulk log delete through its Logger, resend through its own resend flow on 2.3+ (original headers and attachments preserved, a per-entry resend history, and a **Resend to…** recipient override), its daily connection-health verdict on the status card and as a System health row, capabilities through its __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ filter, and a **Settings** view (default and fallback connection, logging, retention, email simulation through its own Settings model; the connection wizard stays FluentSMTP's); Post SMTP has search + single/bulk delete; WPML bulk-deletes log rows. Gravity SMTP goes deeper: a **Settings** view maps its own settings schema into Minimal (sending service across all 21 connectors, connector config with masked secrets, general/logging settings through its constant-lock-aware stores), the surface honors its granular __MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__ capabilities (including __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__ for log delete through its own __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__), the event detail reads through its own models (from/cc/bcc/source), resend replays its own recipient handling through the configured connector, a **Suppressions** view lists/adds/reactivates blocked addresses through its own model, a **Debug log** view, a **Routing** view of 2.3+ conditional send rules (enable/disable/delete; condition authoring stays in Gravity SMTP), a **Filtered** log tab for partially-sent events, and a status card with active service, test mode, routing counts, a 14-day chart, and **Send a test email**. SureMails and Site Mailer get the full log treatment over their free log tables (tabs, search, delete, status card + chart, sandboxed HTML detail; Site Mailer is a cloud sender, so no local resend) |"
msgstr "| **電子郵件** | Gravity SMTP、FluentSMTP、WP Mail SMTP、Post SMTP、WP Mail Logging、SureMails、Site Mailer | **電子郵件**介面（功能擴充設定後，從 Email Log 重新命名）— 已寄出郵件、重新寄送、單筆／批次刪除記錄。FluentSMTP、Post SMTP 和 WP Mail Logging 都有狀態卡（14 天圖表）；FluentSMTP 另透過其 Logger 提供測試寄送、主旨／寄件者／收件者搜尋、單筆／批次刪除記錄，並在 2.3+ 透過自身的重新寄送流程重新寄送（保留原始標頭和附件、每筆記錄的重新寄送歷史，以及 **重新寄送至…** 收件者覆寫），在狀態卡及 System health 列中提供每日連線健康判定，透過其 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 篩選器提供權限，並提供 **設定**檢視（預設和備援連線、記錄、保留期限、透過自身 Settings 模型進行電子郵件模擬；連線精靈仍由 FluentSMTP 提供）；Post SMTP 提供搜尋及單筆／批次刪除；WPML 可批次刪除記錄列。Gravity SMTP 的功能更深入：**設定**檢視會將其自身設定結構映射至 Minimal（全部 21 個連接器中的寄送服務、含遮罩密鑰的連接器設定、透過具備常數鎖定感知的儲存區處理一般／記錄設定），此介面遵循其細分的 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__ 權限（包括透過其自身 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__ 進行記錄刪除的 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__），事件詳細資料透過其自身模型讀取（寄件者／副本／密件副本／來源），重新寄送會透過已設定的連接器重播其自身的收件者處理流程，**抑制項目**檢視透過其自身模型列出／新增／重新啟用遭封鎖的地址，提供 **偵錯記錄**檢視、2.3+ 條件式寄送規則的 **路由**檢視（啟用／停用／刪除；條件編寫仍在 Gravity SMTP 中進行）、顯示部分寄送事件的 **已篩選**記錄分頁，以及包含啟用中的服務、測試模式、路由數量、14 天圖表和 **寄送測試電子郵件**的狀態卡。SureMails 和 Site Mailer 會針對其免費記錄表提供完整記錄功能（分頁、搜尋、刪除、狀態卡＋圖表、沙盒化 HTML 詳細資料；Site Mailer 是雲端寄件者，因此沒有本機重新寄送） |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:34
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Ecommerce** | WooCommerce, **WooCommerce Subscriptions** | **Orders** (full-page order view with its own URL plus a quick-view modal; list, search, status, **Record payment** by hand through __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__, line-item refunds with restock and gateway-honest copy, pay URL, resend/custom email, order notes, the customer's other orders, **New order**, an Overview **Store strip** of orders needing attention, **Analytics** view with revenue chart + top products via __MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__; WooCommerce log channels also feed the System log viewer through its own log controller) + **Products** (list, search, stock tabs incl. Low stock, bulk, daily fields, **Add product**) + **Coupons** (list/create/edit) + **Customers** (list/search, profile + billing, recent orders; **Subscriptions** strip when WCS is active) + Overview stats. **Subscriptions** (when WCS is active): status tabs, search, next payment, period label, status save through __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__, parent order + related orders, View customer, and a reverse link from the order modal. Product, coupon and subscription CPTs are fenced out of Content |"
msgstr "| **電子商務** | WooCommerce、**WooCommerce Subscriptions** | **訂單**（完整頁面的訂單檢視，具有自身 URL 和快速檢視 modal；列出、搜尋、狀態、透過 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 手動 **記錄付款**、包含補貨且文案忠實反映 gateway 的單項退款、付款 URL、重新寄送／自訂電子郵件、訂單備註、該客戶的其他訂單、**新增訂單**、總覽中顯示需處理訂單的 **Store strip**、含營收圖表 + 透過 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__ 取得熱門產品的 **Analytics** 檢視；WooCommerce 記錄頻道也會透過自身的 log controller 餵入系統記錄檢視器）+ **產品**（列出、搜尋、庫存分頁，包括低庫存、批次、每日欄位、**新增產品**）+ **優惠券**（列出／建立／編輯）+ **客戶**（列出／搜尋、個人資料 + 帳單、近期訂單；WCS 啟用時顯示 **Subscriptions** strip）+ 總覽統計。**訂閱**（WCS 啟用時）：狀態分頁、搜尋、下次付款、期間標籤、透過 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__ 儲存狀態、父訂單 + 相關訂單、檢視客戶，以及訂單 modal 的反向連結。產品、優惠券與訂閱 CPT 會從 Content 中隔離 |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:42
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Dev tools** | Query Monitor; **Diagnostics** family (Scrutoscope, WP Crontrol, Transients Manager, Rewrite Rules Inspector) | QM panel on Minimal pages (this-request). One Tools item **Diagnostics** with a provider switcher: **Scrutoscope** (performance profiles + Cron inventory; on 1.4+ **Profile this hook** runs the hook under their profiler and saves an on-demand profile), **WP Crontrol** (event inventory, run-now, pause/resume, delete), **Transients Manager** (list/search/delete, expired purge, never unserializes blobs), **Rewrite Rules Inspector** (registered rules by source, search by path, flush, test URL). Capture settings, PHP/URL cron authoring, deep transient edit, and the full RRI screen stay deep-linked |"
msgstr "| **開發者工具** | Query Monitor；**Diagnostics** 家族（Scrutoscope、WP Crontrol、Transients Manager、Rewrite Rules Inspector） | Minimal 頁面上的 QM 面板（本次請求）。一個 **Diagnostics** 工具項目，含提供者切換器：**Scrutoscope**（效能剖析 + Cron inventory；1.4+ 的 **Profile this hook** 會在其剖析器下執行該 hook 並儲存按需剖析結果）、**WP Crontrol**（事件 inventory、立即執行、暫停／恢復、刪除）、**Transients Manager**（列出／搜尋／刪除、清除過期項目，絕不反序列化 blobs）、**Rewrite Rules Inspector**（按來源列出已註冊規則、依路徑搜尋、flush、測試 URL）。擷取設定、PHP／URL cron 建立、深度 transient 編輯，以及完整的 RRI 畫面仍維持深度連結 |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:33
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Custom fields** | ACF (+ Pro), Meta Box, Pods | Editor panel (text, textarea, number, select, radio, checkbox/switch/boolean). ACF needs \"Show in REST API\" on the field group; Meta Box values ride a __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ REST field (__MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__); Pods values ride __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__ (__MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__ on extended post types). Advanced types (clones, file, relationships, multi-pick…) count as locked with a wp-admin link |"
msgstr "| **自訂欄位** | ACF（+ Pro）、Meta Box、Pods | 編輯器面板（文字、textarea、數字、select、radio、checkbox／switch／boolean）。ACF 需要在欄位群組中啟用「Show in REST API」；Meta Box 值透過 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ REST 欄位（__MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__）；Pods 值透過 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__（擴充文章類型使用 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__）。進階類型（複製、檔案、關聯、多重選取……）會標記為鎖定，並提供 wp-admin 連結 |"

