msgstr "| 2026-08-06 | Residual-suite 通過（掃描收尾） | 更新波次中剩餘的 active-fixture adapters 已通過測試套件驗證：seo-mappers 11（**確認 AIOSEO 4.9.10→5.0.0.1 MAJOR 相容**——測試套件使用 AIOSEO 自有 model 驅動面板；Yoast 28.2 + SEOPress 10.1 也涵蓋）、media-folders 20（FileBird 6.5.7）、tec-panel 8（TEC 6.17.2）、cache-purge 11（Breeze 2.5.12）、activity-log-status 20（Simple History 5.30）、meta-box-panel 19（Meta Box 5.14）。全部通過，不需修正。掃描週期完全結束：待辦為空，fixture 欠款已清除。記錄中的未排名未來候選者：Really Simple SSL 9.7 posture provider（plugin-support waves）、GoSMTP 維持已說明的跳過項目（免費版本不儲存日誌）。 |"

#: docs/adapter-coverage.md:204
msgctxt "docs/adapter-coverage.md"
msgid "| 2026-08-06 | Forms family status cards (Axis A parity batch, ship top 1 third slice) | Five cards matching the SureForms shape: **fluent-forms** (unread + total/spam hint from fluentform_submissions, forms count), **ninja-forms** (live nf_sub publish count + trash hint — NOT nf3_forms.subs, which survives deletes; no read state exists so the headline is Submissions), **forminator** (received/spam counts mirroring the entries list's exact scope: entry_type custom-forms, drafts/abandoned stay on their screen), **cf7-flamingo** (core wp_count_posts on their CPT — publish/flamingo-spam/trash, zero model queries), **everest-forms** (unread = publish minus viewed=1, spam hint — added beyond the ranked four because family consistency was the why). Each links out to the plugin's real entries screen (slugs verified in plugin source: fluent_forms_all_entries / nf-submissions / forminator-entries / flamingo_inbound / evf-entries). Suite forms-status (12); regressions fluent-forms 24 / ninja 13 / forminator 12 / cf7-flamingo 19 / everest 16 all green. Integrations validator clean. |"
msgstr "| 2026-08-06 | Forms 系列狀態卡（Axis A 對等批次，出貨排名 1 第三個切片） | 五張符合 SureForms 形狀的卡片：**fluent-forms**（從 fluentform_submissions 取得未讀 + 總數/垃圾郵件提示、表單數量）、**ninja-forms**（即時 nf-sub publish 計數 + 垃圾桶提示——不是 nf3_forms.subs，該資料會在刪除後保留；不存在讀取狀態，因此標題為 Submissions）、**forminator**（反映 entries list 精確範圍的 received/spam 計數：entry_type custom-forms，草稿/放棄項目仍留在其畫面）、**cf7-flamingo**（其 CPT 上的核心 wp_count_posts——publish/flamingo-spam/trash，不查詢任何 model）、**everest-forms**（未讀 = publish 減去 viewed=1、垃圾郵件提示——因系列一致性而在排名前四之外加入）。每張卡都連結至外掛真正的 entries 畫面（外掛來源已驗證 slugs：fluent_forms_all_entries / nf-submissions / forminator-entries / flamingo_inbound / evf-entries）。測試套件 forms-status（12）；回歸測試 fluent-forms 24 / ninja 13 / forminator 12 / cf7-flamingo 19 / everest 16 全部通過。Integrations validator 通過。 |"

