msgid "| 2026-07-17 | Move to folder (media bulk bar) | Contract gains OPTIONAL __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ (0 = out of every folder; boot mediaFolders.move gates the UI; route POST media/folders/move registers only when offered, upload_files + provider's own checks). Bulk bar grows a folder picker + Move button (Move disabled until a pick; counts cache busted after). All three providers wired through their own machinery: FileBird verifyAuthor + Folder::assignFolder (their hooks + counters fire), RML wp_rml_move (their validation, root -1 for out), Premio wp_set_object_terms (empty list = Unassigned). All three move-probed both directions; suite media-folders 20 |"
msgstr "| 2026-07-17 | 移至資料夾（媒體批次列） | 合約新增選用的 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__（0 = 不在任何資料夾中；啟動 mediaFolders.move 會控制 UI；路由 POST media/folders/move 僅在提供時註冊，並檢查 upload_files＋供應商自身條件）。批次列新增資料夾選擇器＋移動按鈕（選取前停用 Move；完成後清除計數快取）。三個供應商皆透過自身機制接線：FileBird 驗證 verifyAuthor＋Folder::assignFolder（其 hooks＋計數器會觸發）、RML wp_rml_move（其驗證，根目錄 -1 表示移出）、Premio wp_set_object_terms（空清單 = Unassigned）。三者皆已測試兩個方向；套件 media-folders 20 |"

