msgid "| 2026-07-17 | Mail family sections detail (Axis A) | fluent-smtp, post-smtp, wp-mail-logging log detail converted to sectionsRoute with the new row types (GSMTP pattern): status pill, sandboxed html-preview/code body, per-store extras (provider-reply peek, failure + suggested fix, raw headers). Flat routes kept for API consumers; mail-log suite 30 |"
msgstr "| 2026-07-17 | 郵件家族 sections 詳細資料（Axis A） | fluent-smtp、post-smtp、wp-mail-logging 的記錄詳細資料已轉換為 sectionsRoute，使用新的列類型（GSMTP 模式）：狀態膠囊、沙盒化 HTML 預覽／程式碼內容、各儲存區額外資訊（供應商回覆預覽、失敗＋建議修正、原始標頭）。保留扁平路由供 API 消費者使用；mail-log 套件 30 |"

#: docs/adapter-coverage.md:185
msgctxt "docs/adapter-coverage.md"
msgid "| 2026-07-17 | GF Feeds view (backlog rank 10 resolved) | VERDICT: the feeds VIEW ships, the config MAPPER defers. New Feeds __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ entry on the GF surface (registers only while a GFFeedAddOn is present): every add-on integration across forms with per-form tabs, activate/deactivate (GFFormsModel::update_feed_property), delete (GFAPI::delete_feed), deep link to the add-on's feed screen (subview={slug}&fid={id}). HARD-WON: GFAPI::get_feeds defaults $is_active=true — pass null or deactivated feeds vanish (bit during the build); their \"not_found\" WP_Error just means zero feeds. Config mapper deferred with a written verdict in full-ui-adapters.md (needs a second item-scoped settings primitive + a creds-free mappable add-on fixture). FIXTURE: gravityformstwilio ACTIVE on minimaladmin (copied from anchor, the GF convention). Suite gf-feeds (10); gf-notifications' pinned switcher list relaxed to first-three (rule-52 class) |"
msgstr "| 2026-07-17 | GF Feeds 檢視（待辦排名 10 已解決） | 判定：發布 feeds 檢視，設定 MAPPER 延後。GF 介面新增 Feeds __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 項目（僅在存在 GFFeedAddOn 時註冊）：每個表單中的所有附加元件整合，各表單分頁、啟用／停用（GFFormsModel::update_feed_property）、刪除（GFAPI::delete_feed）、深層連結至附加元件的 feed 畫面（subview={slug}&fid={id}）。重要發現：GFAPI::get_feeds 預設 $is_active=true——傳入 null，否則停用的 feed 會消失（建置期間踩到）；其「not_found」WP_Error 僅表示沒有 feed。設定對應器延後，完整 UI Adapter 文件中已有書面判定（需要第二個項目範圍設定原語，以及不含憑證的可對應附加元件 fixture）。FIXTURE：minimaladmin 上的 gravityformstwilio 已啟用（從 anchor 複製，符合 GF 慣例）。套件 gf-feeds（10）；gf-notifications 的固定切換器清單放寬為前三項（rule-52 類別） |"

